<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5284" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bĭbŭlus</span></b> , i,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a proper name.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> L. Publicius Bibulus, <i>a military tribune in the time of the second Punic
				war</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 22, 53,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> M.
			(in Appian. Civ. 2, 8, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αεύκιος</span>)
			Calpurnius Bibulus, <i>a contemporary of
				Cœsar</i>, <i>consul with him</i>
			A.U.C. 695, <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">20</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">49</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Cic. Vatin. 9, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Fam. 1,
				9, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Att. 1, 17, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 14,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 19, 2</span></i>; 6,  1, 13; 6, 8,
			5.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b> C.
			Bibulus, <i>an œdile</i> A.U.C. 775, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 3,
			52</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
